{"4525470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shoku Pain", "steam_appid": 4525470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years ago, a new viral outbreak began in Japan. Scientists are racing for a cure, but progress is slow, and the virus continues to tear through the country. The government has split the nation into zones and imposed a strict curfew. People only leave their homes to reach food distribution points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The virus doesn't kill right away. It takes over the mind instead. The infected are almost impossible to tell apart from the healthy. Almost...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been placed inside a sealed bakery, producing <strong>SHOKUPAN</strong> bread. You must meet your assigned quota. Fail, and the system stops protecting you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the healthy. Medicate the sick. Kill the infected... There's more than just customers on the other side of that window. Someone is watching you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Closely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer waits behind the glass. Use every tool at your disposal to uncover the truth — trust your eyes, your instruments, and your instincts. Nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/4f903cb684ba408ffcbbdc24696b56a6.poster.avif?t=1786712276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/4f903cb684ba408ffcbbdc24696b56a6.webm?t=1786712276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/4f903cb684ba408ffcbbdc24696b56a6.mp4?t=1786712276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Report. Decide.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill out the report based on what you've observed. Then act on it: hand over bread. Give medicine. Or ready your knife... Choose carefully — every wrong call costs you your quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/08e4b18a218832456b5096a79453c764.poster.avif?t=1786712276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/08e4b18a218832456b5096a79453c764.webm?t=1786712276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/08e4b18a218832456b5096a79453c764.mp4?t=1786712276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare the Order</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the recipe. Mix the ingredients. Set the oven. Package the product... Every correct order brings you closer to quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/042213fcad69773cec07ae7fe280d7d0.poster.avif?t=1786712276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/042213fcad69773cec07ae7fe280d7d0.webm?t=1786712276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/042213fcad69773cec07ae7fe280d7d0.mp4?t=1786712276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMEONE'S OUT THERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's someone outside the window. Watching you. You don't know what they want... yet. Don't take your eyes off the glass.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/264f5ed876ef9e757dab8f111585f107.poster.avif?t=1786712276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/264f5ed876ef9e757dab8f111585f107.webm?t=1786712276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/264f5ed876ef9e757dab8f111585f107.mp4?t=1786712276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years ago, a new viral outbreak began in Japan. Scientists are racing for a cure, but progress is slow, and the virus continues to tear through the country. The government has split the nation into zones and imposed a strict curfew. People only leave their homes to reach food distribution points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The virus doesn't kill right away. It takes over the mind instead. The infected are almost impossible to tell apart from the healthy. Almost...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been placed inside a sealed bakery, producing <strong>SHOKUPAN</strong> bread. You must meet your assigned quota. Fail, and the system stops protecting you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the healthy. Medicate the sick. Kill the infected... There's more than just customers on the other side of that window. Someone is watching you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Closely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer waits behind the glass. Use every tool at your disposal to uncover the truth — trust your eyes, your instruments, and your instincts. Nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4525470/extras/4f903cb684ba408ffcbbdc24696b56a6.poster.avi